// Windows resource script: gives ac3gui.exe its own file/taskbar/Explorer
// icon. Generated (configure_file, @ONLY) into the build tree by
// CMakeLists.txt rather than committed as a plain .rc, so AC3_GUI_ICON_ICO
// carries an absolute path - IDI_ICON1 resolves relative to the current
// working directory of the rc.exe invocation, not this file's own location,
// and that directory isn't guaranteed to be apps/gui/icons/.
IDI_ICON1 ICON "@AC3_GUI_ICON_ICO@"
